# ============================================================================
# Sofi — prod desktop build environment template
#
# Copy to `.env.production` and fill in real values. `.env.production` is
# gitignored. Vite auto-loads it when it runs in production mode, which
# happens during `pnpm tauri build`.
#
# This file is for FRONTEND build-time values only — Vite bakes VITE_*
# variables into the distributable bundle. Django backend prod values
# (DATABASE_URL, DJANGO_SECRET_KEY, GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET, etc.) belong on
# the hosting platform's secret store, never in a committed or
# bundle-embedded file.
#
# See `docs/oauth-setup.md` for how to register a SECOND pair of OAuth
# apps dedicated to prod (separate from the dev apps).
# ============================================================================

# Must match the client_id registered in the PROD Google "Desktop app" OAuth
# client, and the PROD GitHub OAuth App.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
VITE_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
